T:Lord, Dismiss Us With Thy Blessing
T:REGENT SQUARE
C:Music: Henry Smart, 1867 · Words: John Fawcett, 1773; verse 3 alt. by Godfrey Thring, 1880
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "Psalms and Hymns for Divine Worship", 1867 Hymn 58. Fawcett's original 3 verses can be found in "The Anglican Hymn Book" of 1871 Hymn 332. modified verse three. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/regent_square_smart): 100% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
